# ==============================================================================
# COPILOT MULTI-ACCOUNT FLEET CONFIGURATION (.env.fleet)
# ==============================================================================
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Generate Fine-Grained Personal Access Tokens (v2) on GitHub:
#    Settings -> Developer Settings -> Personal Access Tokens -> Fine-grained tokens
# 2. Scope & Permissions:
#    - Repository access: "All repositories" (or select repositories workers should touch)
#    - Account permissions: "Copilot Requests" -> Read & Write
# 3. Paste the generated tokens (github_pat_...) below for each account.
# 4. Total Pooled Monthly Capacity across all 13 accounts: 2,600 AI credits (13 x 200).
# ==============================================================================

